**Trying out Medium’s photo post thingy.** These are three that I took at and around Adobe’s Union Square office yesterday, where we were flipping the switch on [Typekit Marketplace](https://typekit.com/marketplace). From left/top:

-   [Jake Giltsoff](https://medium.com/u/5606513d51e9) with the giant box of his beloved Swedish Fish, sent by our awesome teammate Liz Galle
-   Sunlight peeking down 19th Street at 5th Avenue at 8:05 AM, as I walked to the office for an 8:40 AM product launch. (FYI, we usually don’t start Typekitting until more like 12 PM, Eastern time.)
-   Adobe has a “dongle mart” for if you need an adapter, cable, or other accessory for work and don’t want to walk four blocks to Staples. I would wager this inventory will be growing to include a fuckton of Thunderbolt 3/USB-C stuff very soon.
